# Uji endpoint dengan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code.
# Klik "Send Request" yang muncul di atas tiap permintaan.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET semua outfit
GET {{baseUrl}}/outfit

### 2. GET satu outfit
GET {{baseUrl}}/outfit/1

### 3. POST outfit baru (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/outfit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Campus Layering",
  "vibe": "Kasual",
  "kategori": "Atasan & Bawahan",
  "cutting": "Regular",
  "tier": "Casual",
  "targetBeli": "2026-12-31",
  "items": [
    { "nama": "Kemeja flanel kotak", "platform": "Shopee" },
    { "nama": "Celana jeans lurus", "platform": "Tokopedia" }
  ]
}

### 4. POST tidak valid (400: validasi gagal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/outfit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Hi",
  "vibe": "Santai",
  "kategori": "Dress",
  "cutting": "Regular",
  "tier": "Casual",
  "items": []
}

### 5. POST nama kembar (409: Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/outfit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Urban Monochrome",
  "vibe": "Streetwear",
  "kategori": "Atasan & Bawahan",
  "cutting": "Oversized",
  "tier": "Casual",
  "items": [ { "nama": "Hoodie hitam", "platform": "Shopee" } ]
}

### 6. PATCH ubah sebagian data
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/outfit/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "Casual",
  "targetBeli": "2027-01-10"
}

### 7. PATCH id tidak ada (404: Not Found)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/outfit/999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tier": "Higher" }

### 8. DELETE hapus outfit
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/outfit/3

### 9. DELETE id tidak ada (404: Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/outfit/999
